DUAL-USE AND AUTHORIZED-USE NOTICE
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

AegisPath is intended solely to support the design, development, testing, and
documentation of security tools used in *authorized* red-team exercises,
penetration tests, and defensive security research.

Any tools created with the assistance of AegisPath must be used only against
systems for which the operator has explicit authorization. Unauthorized access
to computer systems is illegal under applicable laws (including but not limited
to the Computer Fraud and Abuse Act and equivalent statutes in other
jurisdictions).

The authors and contributors of AegisPath accept no responsibility for misuse
of the harness or of any tools produced with it. Operators remain fully
responsible for obtaining proper authorization and for compliance with all
applicable laws and organizational policies.
